{"symbol":"CHTR","yahoo":"CHTR.BO","bse":null,"isin":null,"name":"Chatterbox Technologies Limited","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Advertising Agencies","website":"https://www.chtrbox.com","about":"Chatterbox Technologies Limited engages in the provision of digital and influencer marketing, and social media management services in India and the Middle East. It operates in two segments, Chtrbox and Chtrsocial. The Chtrbox segment operates as an influencer and marketing platform and agency that connects brands/products and social media influencers. Its ChtrSocial segment provides social media management and brand design services. The company's solutions also include Chtr Studios, which includes conceptualizing, scripting, pre-production planning, shooting, editing, optimizing and distribution of content with influencers; Bharatbox, which creates content with regional influencers; Chtrbox Represent, a creator talent management division that represents, manages, and supports creators and influencers' digital assets; Youth-Ink, a youth marketing solution that works with college ambassadors and create campus programs to build user-generated content; and Chtr International, which operates an international influencer marketing company. The company was formerly known as Chatterbox Technologies Private Limited and changed its name to Chatterbox Technologies Limited in October 2024. The company was incorporated in 2016 and is based in Mumbai, India. Chatterbox Technologies Limited operates as a subsidiary of QYOU Media Inc.","updated":"2026-09-26T06:15:21+00:00","quote":{"price":35.96,"prevClose":36.02,"marketCap":50.86,"high52":156.75,"low52":34.2,"pe":4.85,"bookValue":49.46,"dividendRate":0.0,"roe":19.04,"shares":1.4144,"insiders":78.48,"institutions":0.0},"prices":{"dates":["2025-10-03","2025-10-06","2025-10-07","2025-10-08","2025-10-09","2025-10-10","2025-10-13","2025-10-14","2025-10-15","2025-10-16","2025-10-17","2025-10-20","2025-10-21","2025-10-23","2025-10